#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
big_sweep.py — Big Sweep: All 36 Signals × Full Parameter Sweep

Sweeps all 36 signals through comprehensive LHS-optimized parameter space
with 18 parameters and 3-stage validation.

Outputs:
  data/sweep_results_v1.json       — Raw per-signal config results
  data/sweep_signal_summary.csv    — Per-signal aggregate metrics
  data/sweep_correlation_matrix.csv— Cross-signal correlation matrix
  data/sweep/differential_results.json — All-pairs differential analysis

Usage:
    python3 scripts/big_sweep.py --fast
    python3 scripts/big_sweep.py --n-configs 5000 --stations KNYC KMDW

B-Mode compliant. No AI/ML inside the sweep loop.
"""

